      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tried this today, and it's still an issue. :( \n\nI can't express how insanely confusing it is for signed languages when I'm certain I'm making a particular hand shape or hand pose, but what I'm seeing turns out to be very different to what other people are seeing.\n\nIf I had to guess, it's that the beautifully hand tracked poses are \"decaying\" to Index gesture poses, which is very very confusing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
